{
  "name": "@ab/web-kit",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Shared React DOM code of the staff web app (apps/staff-web) and the family web app (apps/family-web), docs/51 §2: SOURCE, built by each app's Vite; apps import it through `exports` (one entry per area), its own files through `imports` (#/…).",
